    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "אישׁ אישׁ",
      "rationale": "Go boela ga lentšu 'motho' gabedi — phetolelo e dira 'motho ofe goba ofe' go bolokela tlhano ya go boela-boela."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "tšhelo ya peo",
      "rationale": "שכבת זרע ke thulaganyo ya go lieha ga peo — 'tšhelo ya peo' e boloka sebopego sa go tšwa ga selo."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Motho ofe goba ofe wa peo ya Aharone, gomme ele gore o kgobeditšwe ke bokgodu bja letlalo goba o na le tšhelo, ga a je dilo tše di kgethwago go fihlela a hlweka; le yo a thuntšhago se sengwe se se hlokgobišago moya, goba motho yoo mo tšwago tšhelo ya peo.",
